{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03167","headline":"和姚令公哭李尚书乂 · 张九龄","name":"和姚令公哭李尚书乂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贵贱虽殊等，平生窃下风。\n云泥势已绝，山海纳还通。\n忽叹登龙者，翻将吊鹤同。\n琴诗犹可托，剑履独成空。\n畴昔尝论礼，兴言每匪躬。\n人思崔琰议，朝掩祭遵公。\n作善神何酷，依仁命不融。\n天文虚北斗，人事罢南宫。\n上幸既伤旧，下流弥感衷。\n无恩报国士，徒欲问玄穹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}